   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Caroline,<div><br></div><div>Sorry for the delay. The syntax you&#39;ve used is unfortunately not valid in mirt in that mixedmirt() does not support regression models onto other factors in the more SEM flavour (not that it couldn&#39;t, I just haven&#39;t added this feature yet). It&#39;s on the long TODO list though, so perhaps sometime in a future release this feature will appear. HTH.</div><div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Phil</div></div></div></div><br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, May 27, 2020 at 2:05 PM Caroline Lancaster &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">carolin...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div>"
    ],
